\eqn{(a_j+a_k)/2} expression is an ansatz. It is still a valid
cross-covariance, so it is permitted -- with a warning, because the
generating model is then \strong{not} the one \code{\link[=fit]{fit()}} estimates. Use
\code{method = "rff"} for the exact model at any \eqn{a_j}.
